You blight a zone as a decaying ground for 5 turns. All creatures inside take [23, 31, 37, 42, 46 (TL1-5; SP 100; MP 100)] blight damage per turn and have all their cooldowns increased by [25%, 36%, 45%, 53%, 60% (TL1-5)] for 3 turns.

The damage will scale with the highest of your spell or mind power.
